OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive and happier
OL,9,Fmoments happening across the West
OL,10,FMidlands - and we want to celebrate and
OL,11,Fshare them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have heard how a doorman
OL,14,Fsaved a man's life when he started to
OL,15,Fchoke on a piece of kebab, how a group
OL,16,Fof elderly women went viral for a
OL,17,Fdance-off, and how the subjects of a
OL,18,Ffamous photo reunited 50 years after it
OL,19,Fwas taken.
OL,21,FHere is a look at some of those news
OL,22,Fstories from across the region:
